            "review_text": "Wally Stennine\n3 contributions\n0\nRomantic restaurant\nAug 2020\nMy friends recommend this restaurant as the most romantic restaurant in Dalat. And I can’t deny that It’s correct. On my anniversary with my girlfriend, I booked a dinner here. They arranged candle light with flower on the table for us. Our table was on balcony. We immersed ourself in piano sound and good wine. Highly recommend for any anniversary.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 6, 2020",
