            "review_title": "Review at Le Rabelais Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Lunymar\nHanoi, Vietnam103 contributions\n1\nFabulous food in sumptous surroundings\nJul 2020\nWe dined at Le Rabelais three times in total during our stay and were very impressed each time. The service was absolutely impeccable and the food top notch, which in fairness you would expect at these prices. Special mention must go to the creme brulee dessert with caramelised banana and passionfruit sorbet. My husband reckoned it's the best dessert he's ever had - and he's had a lot of very good desserts! \n\nHighly recommended for a special occasion.\nWritten July 15, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
