            "review_title": "Review at Le Rabelais Restaurant",
            "review_text": "F L\n33 contributions\n1\nexcellent\nJan 2020 • Family\nI have been with my dad to have a meal in this restaurant and we were very surprise because everything was perfect: the music coming from the pianist, the room of the restaurant and of course the food. we took the \"menu plaisir\" at 1.7M VND and it was excellent. Of course the price is high for Vietnam but in France for this quality you will have to pay at least 200€ (I am french living in Paris). Next time I will come back to Dalat I will come back to go there for sure.\nWritten January 15, 2020",
