            "review_text": "Daryl K\nThep Sadet, Thailand1 contribution\n1\nBe overrated too much\nAug 2019 • Friends\nJust had dinner here, beautiful restaurant but that's all they have, poor food, only waitress have qualified service with good English, the supervisor guy sucks, really have no idea why he can get this job, the chicken was dry and hard like stone, I talked to him but just got impolite response and then kept hiding my eyesight... well, if this is the best restaurant in Dalat, I can't imagine others\nWritten August 2, 2019",
