            "review_title": "Review at Le Rabelais Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Stanga06\nParis, France15 contributions\n3\nDo not even give a try!\nMar 2019 • Couples\nFrench living in Vietnam since few years, we went there for a special occasion and we strongly regret it.\nIt is totally over rated, food was so lame, we took the full set menu and got half hard-boiled egg as appetizer, a poor asparagus soup then followed by a basic green salad that you usually serve to turtles.\nMain course, rossini beef, mine was just ok, the other was disgusting by the texture, it felt like it was battered for years to make it tender, we couldn't eat it.\nDessert, creme brulée, was served with a kind of ice cream which was more ice than cream, the creme brulée had a sugar crust which required a hammer to eat it.\n\nWine, of course our first choice was out of stock, the one chosen was overpriced, an 8$ bottle offered for 60$.\n\nThe only good point was the pianist who unfortunately stopped playing at 10.\n\nTo summarize, this place is a joke, I recommend not even to give a try.\nRead more\nWritten March 24, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
