            "review_text": "Luckylibrarian-The Last Hurrah\nArizona1051 contributions\n0\nEasy Lunch in Peaceful Environment- Understand Gluten Free\nMar 2019 • Friends\nI wanted a simple American lunch so opted for a bun-less burger with bacon and fries. A small salad with balsamic vinaigrette came with the meal. The waitperson was able to recommend a mostly gluten free dessert - it came with a wafer that I removed. My partner had the Chicken Cordon Bleu and loved it. The portions aren’t large, but that works for us. lovely view. Burger was 200,000 Vietnamese Dung or about 10 US dollars.\nWritten March 15, 2019",
