            "review_text": "Dave M\nPuerto de la Duquesa, Spain161 contributions\n0\nNice food in Da Lat\nJul 2018 • Couples\nDon't know how we missed this place when we booked our visit to Da Lat, but glad we found it.\nThe surroundings are very nice, but so is the food, I started with the French onion soup which was probably the best I have tasted anywhere, the main we had tenderloin which was cooked very nicely, accompanied by creamed spinach.\nThere's a really good wine selection which is nice to finish off sitting on the terrace.\nThe service was excellent, a great experience all round, the next time in Da Lat we will be staying at this hotel.\nWritten July 5, 2018",
