            "review_title": "Review at Le Rabelais Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Apsara65\nPerth, Australia299 contributions\n0\nLovely Christmas Day Lunch\nDec 2017 • Family\nOur family if four enjoyed a delicious lunch at Le Rabelais on Christmas Day. We chose the set menu and it was all delicious. We enjoyed a lovely bottle of wine with our lunch as well. The service was very good. The setting is gorgeous in a beautiful dining room in a renovated old colonial French building with sweeping views of the river. There are some beautifully appointed dining rooms off the corridor and interesting pictures on the walls about the Dalat Palace Hotel ( previously the Lang Bian Palace Hotel) .\nWritten December 29, 2017",
